/// civicdebateboard_user_devices}, sessions {@link
/// civicdebateboard_sessions}, consents {@link
/// civicdebateboard_user_consents}, and role overlays {@link
/// civicdebateboard_members}, {@link civicdebateboard_verifiedmembers},
/// {@link civicdebateboard_factcheckers}, {@link
/// civicdebateboard_moderators}, {@link civicdebateboard_admins}.
